{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233320","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423332001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 아이들 이름을 부르고 계시던데, 무슨 일인가요?","source_cn":"您好！我听到您在叫孩子们的名字，这里的孩子怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D3799EAC5A6E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423332002:1":{"text":"우리 제이미랑 마을 아이들 몇 명이 사라졌어요. 혹시 숲으로 들어간 건 아닐까 걱정되네요.","source_cn":"我的孩子詹米和村里的几个小孩都跑得不见人影，我害怕他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE37C8A4DA82A18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423332003:1":{"text":"정말이지, 왜 이렇게 걱정을 끼치는지! 어른도 없이 가서 위험해지면 어쩌려고...","source_cn":"真是不让人省心！没有大人在身边，遇到危险可怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B8EEAB0A77AE54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423332004:1":{"text":"너무 걱정하지 마세요. 저희도 아이들을 찾아볼게요!","source_cn":"您别着急，我们也来帮忙找孩子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48BEB4EADFD4D48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民胡丽诺":{"text":"평민 헤리나","source":"平民胡丽诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}